  unitName: Hope Champion Arthur (EU)
  unitId: 750287
  unitNumber: 7240
  description: "Life is hard in this world without technology. Diseases abound, wars
    rage, and people work their whole lives to just barely get by. Sources of hope
    and joy are few. So, expectations were high the day a young and powerful knight
    took the throne promising peace and prosperity. However, the new ruler had a
    specific goal in mind: finding the Grail. Little by little, his interest in this
    quest turned into an obsession. He abandoned his other duties, using all of the
    kingdom\u2019s resources in order to carry out his quest. The road was long.
    Hardly anyone believed in the Grail\u2019s existence. But Arthur was incensed.
    He insisted and assured everyone that everything would be resolved once the quest
    was completed. And the quest was completed. Arthur found the Grail. The kingdom
    went into a fervor. Everywhere banquets were organized, people praised and applauded
    the King, and newborns were baptized with the name Arthur in his honor. It was
    a year of celebration. Prosperity returned to the kingdom, the harvest was good,
    and hope returned. But Arthur wasn\u2019t satisfied. He couldn\u2019t just stop
    there. His quest had not yet ended. Equipped with the Grail, he had to find and
    vanquish the demon, Enquibedes. He thus set off on the hunt again. Arthur, invincible
    thanks to the Grail, abandoned his other duties once again, and used all of the
    kingdom\u2019s resources in order to pursue the demon. Little by little, the
    enthusiasm brought about by the discovery of the Grail faded and the country
    sank once more into gloom."
  summonDesc: What quest must I complete?
  fusionDesc: "I must continue... The quest isn\u2019t over."
  evoDesc: A new quest awaits me! I must complete it!
